## Design System

```
Background:  #0a0a0f (near black)
Card:        rgba(255,255,255,0.05) + backdrop-blur
Primary:     #6366f1 (indigo)
Success:     #22c55e (green)
Border:      rgba(255,255,255,0.1)
Text:        #f1f5f9
```

Font: **Inter** (Google Fonts)

